{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/blog/layout,_N_T_/blog/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/blog/[slug]/page,_N_T_/blog/best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/blog/$d$slug","/blog","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0wa60lc2wlwoc.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/15orcrkp-_9ct.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2ncdmtj91g36a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/166-a3utgd-lq.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-10b5wutro9flo.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script async=\"\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-6710458178434465\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-C9HPD23Y02\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><title>Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dive into the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"fish names, aquatic pets, turtle names, aquarium names, water pet names\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"p:domain_verify\" content=\"acc18c9aa2855ead49c874b6cac9cb61\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets/\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dive into the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Dive into the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\",\"description\":\"Free animal name generator with 989+ animals. Browse thousands of name ideas across 9 categories.\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animals?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[#f8fafc] text-[#1e293b]\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"bg-white border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 z-50\"><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/\">🐾 AnimalNameGen</a><div class=\"flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">Animals</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/japanese-animal-names/\">Guides</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></div></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\" aria-label=\"Main content\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles & More 🐠\",\"description\":\"Dive into the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-16\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-06\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets/\"},\"wordCount\":279,\"articleBody\":\" Aquatic pets bring the serenity of water into your home. From shimmering {betta-fish} and {goldfish} to graceful {turtle}s and mysterious {axolotl}s, each aquatic companion deserves a name as beautiful as the underwater world they represent. This guide covers naming ideas for every type of aquatic pet. Fish Names by Type 🐟 Different fish species inspire different naming styles. For elegant {betta-fish}: <strong>Neptune</strong>, <strong>Poseidon</strong>, <strong>Sapphire</strong>, <strong>Velvet</strong>, <strong>Zephyr</strong>, <strong>Lagoon</strong>. Their flowing fins suggest graceful names: <strong>Aria</strong>, <strong>Ballet</strong>, <strong>Cascade</strong>, <strong>Ripple</strong>. For playful {goldfish}: <strong>Bubbles</strong>, <strong>Nemo</strong>, <strong>Sunny</strong>, <strong>Goldie</strong>, <strong>Flash</strong>, <strong>Clementine</strong>. For {guppy} and tetra schools: group names like <strong>The Beatles</strong>, <strong>The Spice Girls</strong>, or gemstone collections — <strong>Ruby</strong>, <strong>Opal</strong>, <strong>Topaz</strong>. For bottom-feeders like <strong>plecos</strong> and <strong>corydoras</strong>: <strong>Hoover</strong>, <strong>Sucker</strong>, <strong>Dyson</strong>. Turtle & Aquatic Reptile Names 🐢 Turtles and aquatic reptiles have outsized personalities in their shelled bodies. Classic turtle names: <strong>Michelangelo</strong>, <strong>Donatello</strong>, <strong>Leonardo</strong>, <strong>Raphael</strong> (TMNT!), <strong>Squirt</strong>, <strong>Crush</strong>, <strong>Tank</strong>, <strong>Shelly</strong>, <strong>Bowser</strong>, <strong>Koopa</strong>. More creative options: <strong>Sheldon</strong> (the Big Bang Theory), <strong>Franklin</strong> (the children's book turtle), <strong>Mock Turtle</strong> (Alice in Wonderland), <strong>Morla</strong> (Neverending Story), <strong>Gamera</strong> (kaiju turtle). Snapping turtles deserve tough names: <strong>Jaws</strong>, <strong>Snappy</strong>, <strong>Chomp</strong>, <strong>Brutus</strong>. Aquatic Invertebrate Names 🦐 Shrimp, snails, crabs, and crayfish add delightful variety to aquariums. For shrimp: <strong>Bubba Gump</strong>, <strong>Scampi</strong>, <strong>Prawn</strong>, <strong>Tempura</strong>, <strong>Tiny</strong>. For snails: <strong>Gary</strong> (SpongeBob!), <strong>Turbo</strong>, <strong>Escargot</strong>, <strong>Shelly</strong>, <strong>Zoom</strong>. For crayfish and lobsters: <strong>Pinchy</strong>, <strong>Clamps</strong>, <strong>Red</strong>, <strong>Rock Lobster</strong>. Themed Aquatic Names 🌊 Ocean mythology names carry majesty: <strong>Triton</strong>, <strong>Calypso</strong>, <strong>Nereus</strong>, <strong>Thalassa</strong>, <strong>Ondine</strong>, <strong>Njord</strong> (Norse sea god). Geographic waters: <strong>Nile</strong>, <strong>Amazon</strong>, <strong>Danube</strong>, <strong>Caspian</strong>, <strong>Pacific</strong>, <strong>Hudson</strong>. Coral reef vibes: <strong>Reef</strong>, <strong>Atoll</strong>, <strong>Lagoon</strong>, <strong>Tide</strong>, <strong>Mangrove</strong>. Bioluminescent deep-sea names: <strong>Abyss</strong>, <strong>Glimmer</strong>, <strong>Phosphor</strong>, <strong>Lantern</strong>, <strong>Twilight</strong>. Pirate-themed names: <strong>Captain</strong>, <strong>Corsair</strong>, <strong>Blackbeard</strong>, <strong>Calico Jack</strong>, <strong>Buccaneer</strong>. Shipwreck names: <strong>Titanic</strong>, <strong>Lusitania</strong> (for fish that survived!), <strong>Marie Celeste</strong>.\",\"image\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I name all my fish in a community tank?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It's fun to name fish you can distinguish, but in large schools, group names or themed collections work best. Naming a few standout individuals is more practical than naming 20 nearly identical tetras.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I tell my fish apart to give individual names?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Look for unique markings, size differences, fin shapes, or behavioral traits. Betta fish and goldfish have distinct enough appearances to name individually. With practice, you will recognize your fish by their habits.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do aquatic pets learn their names?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Some fish, especially bettas and goldfish, can learn to associate sounds with feeding. Turtles definitely recognize their caretakers. While they may not respond to a name like a dog, the name serves your bond and helps you tell their story to others.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are good names for pairs of aquatic pets?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Famous pairs work wonderfully: Bonnie and Clyde, Romeo and Juliet, Lilo and Stitch, Cosmo and Wanda, Yin and Yang. Complementary names: Salt and Pepper, Coral and Reef, Bubbles and Splash.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles & More 🐠\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets/\"}]}</script><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a class=\"hover:text-primary\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium\">Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠</span></nav><article class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><div class=\"text-6xl mb-4\">🐠</div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3\"><span class=\"bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><span>2026-06-16</span><span class=\"text-gray-500\">By BestAnimalNames Editorial Team</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Dive into the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">fish names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">aquatic pets</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">turtle names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">aquarium names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">water pet names</span></div></div><div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 mb-8\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">📋 Table of Contents</h3><ol class=\"space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">1<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#fish\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Fish Names by Type</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">2<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#turtles\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Turtle &amp; Aquatic Reptile Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">3<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#invertebrates\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Aquatic Invertebrate Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">4<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#themed\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Themed Aquatic Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">5<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#faq\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">FAQ</a></li></ol></div><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Aquatic pets bring the serenity of water into your home. From shimmering <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/betta-fish/\">Betta Fish<!-- --> Name Generator</a> and <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/goldfish/\">Goldfish<!-- --> Name Generator</a> to graceful <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/turtle/\">Turtle<!-- --> Name Generator</a>s and mysterious <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/axolotl/\">Axolotl<!-- --> Name Generator</a>s, each aquatic companion deserves a name as beautiful as the underwater world they represent. This guide covers naming ideas for every type of aquatic pet.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Fish Names by Type 🐟</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Different fish species inspire different naming styles. For elegant {betta-fish}: <strong>Neptune</strong>, <strong>Poseidon</strong>, <strong>Sapphire</strong>, <strong>Velvet</strong>, <strong>Zephyr</strong>, <strong>Lagoon</strong>. Their flowing fins suggest graceful names: <strong>Aria</strong>, <strong>Ballet</strong>, <strong>Cascade</strong>, <strong>Ripple</strong>.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">For playful {goldfish}: <strong>Bubbles</strong>, <strong>Nemo</strong>, <strong>Sunny</strong>, <strong>Goldie</strong>, <strong>Flash</strong>, <strong>Clementine</strong>. For {guppy} and tetra schools: group names like <strong>The Beatles</strong>, <strong>The Spice Girls</strong>, or gemstone collections — <strong>Ruby</strong>, <strong>Opal</strong>, <strong>Topaz</strong>. For bottom-feeders like <strong>plecos</strong> and <strong>corydoras</strong>: <strong>Hoover</strong>, <strong>Sucker</strong>, <strong>Dyson</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Turtle &amp; Aquatic Reptile Names 🐢</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Turtles and aquatic reptiles have outsized personalities in their shelled bodies. Classic turtle names: <strong>Michelangelo</strong>, <strong>Donatello</strong>, <strong>Leonardo</strong>, <strong>Raphael</strong> (TMNT!), <strong>Squirt</strong>, <strong>Crush</strong>, <strong>Tank</strong>, <strong>Shelly</strong>, <strong>Bowser</strong>, <strong>Koopa</strong>.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">More creative options: <strong>Sheldon</strong> (the Big Bang Theory), <strong>Franklin</strong> (the children's book turtle), <strong>Mock Turtle</strong> (Alice in Wonderland), <strong>Morla</strong> (Neverending Story), <strong>Gamera</strong> (kaiju turtle). Snapping turtles deserve tough names: <strong>Jaws</strong>, <strong>Snappy</strong>, <strong>Chomp</strong>, <strong>Brutus</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Aquatic Invertebrate Names 🦐</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Shrimp, snails, crabs, and crayfish add delightful variety to aquariums. For shrimp: <strong>Bubba Gump</strong>, <strong>Scampi</strong>, <strong>Prawn</strong>, <strong>Tempura</strong>, <strong>Tiny</strong>. For snails: <strong>Gary</strong> (SpongeBob!), <strong>Turbo</strong>, <strong>Escargot</strong>, <strong>Shelly</strong>, <strong>Zoom</strong>. For crayfish and lobsters: <strong>Pinchy</strong>, <strong>Clamps</strong>, <strong>Red</strong>, <strong>Rock Lobster</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">Themed Aquatic Names 🌊</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Ocean mythology names carry majesty: <strong>Triton</strong>, <strong>Calypso</strong>, <strong>Nereus</strong>, <strong>Thalassa</strong>, <strong>Ondine</strong>, <strong>Njord</strong> (Norse sea god). Geographic waters: <strong>Nile</strong>, <strong>Amazon</strong>, <strong>Danube</strong>, <strong>Caspian</strong>, <strong>Pacific</strong>, <strong>Hudson</strong>. Coral reef vibes: <strong>Reef</strong>, <strong>Atoll</strong>, <strong>Lagoon</strong>, <strong>Tide</strong>, <strong>Mangrove</strong>.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Bioluminescent deep-sea names: <strong>Abyss</strong>, <strong>Glimmer</strong>, <strong>Phosphor</strong>, <strong>Lantern</strong>, <strong>Twilight</strong>. Pirate-themed names: <strong>Captain</strong>, <strong>Corsair</strong>, <strong>Blackbeard</strong>, <strong>Calico Jack</strong>, <strong>Buccaneer</strong>. Shipwreck names: <strong>Titanic</strong>, <strong>Lusitania</strong> (for fish that survived!), <strong>Marie Celeste</strong>.</p></div><section class=\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Should I name all my fish in a community tank?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">It&#x27;s fun to name fish you can distinguish, but in large schools, group names or themed collections work best. Naming a few standout individuals is more practical than naming 20 nearly identical tetras.</p></details><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">How do I tell my fish apart to give individual names?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Look for unique markings, size differences, fin shapes, or behavioral traits. Betta fish and goldfish have distinct enough appearances to name individually. With practice, you will recognize your fish by their habits.</p></details><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Do aquatic pets learn their names?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Some fish, especially bettas and goldfish, can learn to associate sounds with feeding. Turtles definitely recognize their caretakers. While they may not respond to a name like a dog, the name serves your bond and helps you tell their story to others.</p></details><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What are good names for pairs of aquatic pets?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Famous pairs work wonderfully: Bonnie and Clyde, Romeo and Juliet, Lilo and Stitch, Cosmo and Wanda, Yin and Yang. Complementary names: Salt and Pepper, Coral and Reef, Bubbles and Splash.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">🐾 Related Animal Name Generators</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/betta-fish/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐠</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Betta Fish</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/goldfish/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐠</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Goldfish</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/turtle/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐢</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Turtle</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/axolotl/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🦎</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Axolotl</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/highlander/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐱</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Highlander</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/marsupial-mole/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐾</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Marsupial Mole</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/red-eared-slider/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐢</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Red-Eared Slider</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/spiny-lobster/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🦞</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Spiny Lobster</div></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📖 Related Naming Guides</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/popular-cat-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Popular Cat Names — Top Popular Picks 🐱</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/mexican-animal-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span>