mes for Mighty Pets 💪</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Give your pet a name that embodies power, courage, and resilience. Discover 150+ animal names that mean strength from languages and cultures around the world.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-exotic-pets/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🦎</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names for Exotic Pets: Unique Ideas for Rare Companions 🦎</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Naming an exotic pet requires special creativity. From reptiles and amphibians to sugar gliders and hedgehogs, discover perfectly unique names for your rare companion.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-exotic-pets/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Best Animal Names for Exotic Pets: Unique Ideas for Rare Companions 🦎</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-that-mean-wisdom/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Animal Names That Mean Wisdom: Thoughtful Names for Smart Pets 🦉</p></a></nav><div class=\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-lg font-sem