 the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"fish names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"fish names\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"aquatic pets\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"aquatic pets\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"turtle names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"turtle names\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"aquarium names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"aquarium names\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"water pet names\",{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"water pet names\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-lg max-w-none\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\",\"children\":\"📋 Table of Contents\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-2 list-none pl-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[1,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#fish\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Fish Names by Type\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[2,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#turtles\",\"className\":\"text-gray-